# Slicer scratch (3mf, cache, resolved profiles) — regenerated locally
slicer/build/
__pycache__/

# Note: src/lib/data/*.generated.json, static/renders/, and static/plate-thumbs/
# are generated by slicer/filament.py but ARE committed — the site serves them.
# STLs, plates, and the all-parts zip are NOT committed as serving copies: the
# site links their content-addressed bucket URLs (scripts/sync_bucket.py).

# stray OrcaSlicer logs
slicer/*.log

# raw STL drop zone (sort into slicer/parts/ before committing)
slicer/inbox/

# Product images never enter git. Upload them and reference the URL:
#   python scripts/sync_bucket.py --upload <file>   -> paste the image_url
# This used to be an LFS directory; pointer stubs got published as the images
# and broke every hardware photo on the site. See CLAUDE.md.
slicer/images/
